  "body": "**Scoped negative result. No new supplier or \u03ba is claimed.**\n\nThis package tests the exact block-diagonal fusion `(2,2,1,1) -> 6`:\n`diag(A2,B2,a,b) diag(C2,D2,c,d) = diag(A2 C2,B2 D2,ac,bd)`. The direct sum preserves paid rank mass six while replacing two rank-two and two rank-one children with one rank-six child.\n\nThe source-pinned search enumerates all consecutive four-event windows in both complete orientations of the selected gauge44 provider. It finds 28 eligible windows per orientation and a maximum of 13 disjoint fusions. The ideal transformed profile is `{1:2386,2:392,3:432,4:142,5:82,6:13,8:8}` with mass 5,586. Even after granting zero cost to all source, copy, gather, output, frame, hosting, precision and restoration work, its exact ceiling upper endpoint is `1698446697/1000000000000`, below the 5% target `3549113631/2000000000000`. At least 126 zero-charge fusions would be required; 125 fails and 126 passes the exact target brackets.\n\nThis is limited to the pinned `(2,2,1,1)` child shape and strict contiguous windows. PR #1779 covers homogeneous rank-one batches; PR #1866 uses a different `(3,1,1,1)->6` tensor; open PR #1960 optimizes rank-two/rank-three blocks. This package adds the rank-one/rank-two mixed shape and its source census over both full orientations.\n\n**Reproduction**\n\n```sh\npython3 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/complex-rank6-hetero21-seedfb19 --check-only\npython3.12 scripts/research_package.py --package research/complex-rank6-hetero21-seedfb19\n```\n\nThe package metadata check and direct verifier pass locally under Python 3.14; Python 3.12 is unavailable on this host. The selected-record check also passes. The registered replay uses Python 3.12 in CI.\n\nAssignment seed `fb19d5d7333247ee6fd2818087dc4509`, priority revision 3, exact selector base `f0c1cd4495674afcc81d618774949690b504217d`; selected-record SHA-256 `10b9e340fd8e354a37a0c4813c90e5de1dd42044b5f6aca4a3fc5a42b685fa32`. Source archives and selected certificates are unchanged.\n\nPrepared with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance in scope selection, analysis, verifier, certificate, exact cost calculation and writing. No independent human review is claimed. New material is Apache-2.0.",
